## 📜 The Grimoire of UNCOL.gpt  
UNCOL.gpt understands **Spell‑Code** – a highly‑structured, yet lyrical DSL (Domain‑Specific Language) that we Wizards call **_Incantations_**.  

### Core Syntax (the “Runes”)

| Rune | Description | Example |
|------|-------------|----------|
| `🜂` | **Summon** – brings an entity (data, object, service) into existence. | `🜂 DataFlow "tweets" as Stream;` |
